{"id":"n89944-2-7","stage":3,"title":"저만큼 · 那边","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n89944-2-7-1","ko":"아직도 저만큼을 더 가야 하나요?","zh":"还得再走那么远吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아직도","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아직도","audio":"/audio/902d7e7542f94724da66.mp3"}},{"text":"저만큼을","meaning":"那边","explanation":"저만큼：那边；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"저만큼","audio":"/audio/a1762d0321da841de724.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89944","senseId":"2","lemma":"저만큼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저만큼을","audio":"/audio/4819fce5158ffdbccfb7.mp3"}},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多。","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}},{"text":"가야","meaning":"走","explanation":"가다：走；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"13","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가야","audio":"/audio/6aca1779d1b3c7fc08b4.mp3"}},{"text":"하나요?","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","senseId":"4","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"하나요","audio":"/audio/208badeaa54755540b4c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"a1762d0321da841d","term":"저만큼","zh":"那边","audio":"/audio/a1762d0321da841de724.mp3","entryId":"89944","definition":"离开一定距离的地方。","pronunciation":["저만큼"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"走","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"通过某种途径移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"62888","definition":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","pronunciation":["하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8ee36d45079c2d1e69c6.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n89944-2-7-2","ko":"네, 꽤 걸어가야 하니 조금 쉬었다 갑시다.","zh":"是的，还得走不少路，我们先休息一会儿再继续吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"네,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"네：是，行。","readings":[{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17294","senseId":"2","lemma":"네","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네","audio":"/audio/1c0ddfd0050938404c35.mp3"}},{"text":"꽤","meaning":"颇，相当，还","explanation":"꽤：颇，相当，还。","readings":[{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"38264","senseId":"1","lemma":"꽤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꽤","audio":"/audio/130a398219d202b0a1ed.mp3"}},{"text":"걸어가야","meaning":"走去，走过去","explanation":"걸어가다：走去，走过去；어야：表示必要条件；与 하다/되다 合用表示“应该、必须”。","readings":[{"term":"걸어가다","audio":"/audio/352e9811b2262a5d8279.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"32042","senseId":"1","lemma":"걸어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"걸어가야","audio":"/audio/98cc0415d4048c793b2a.mp3"}},{"text":"하니","meaning":"应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）","explanation":"하다：应该、必须（与前面的 -아/어야 合用）；니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62888","sens